   'You take exclusive rights to the school’s version. {companion} keeps the excluded verses in the notebook.'],
  ['The Ballad after the Battle','A returning company wants the ballad to celebrate a victory. A local family wants it to name a loss. {companion} has spoken with both and refuses to call every surviving soldier a hero or every death a willing sacrifice.',
   'You help preserve both accounts with the speakers’ permission. The song can hold grief without deciding whose loss was useful.',
