   'You sell a victory version that erases the family’s account. {companion} no longer lets you speak for the notebook.'],
  ['Who Keeps the Unfinished Song','The school has learned enough to change the song again. {companion} is pleased, then offended, then pleased. They want to travel elsewhere for new verses without leaving the learners indebted to their first teacher.',
   'You support the independent school and their next journey. The competing verses remain available by their authors’ choice.',
   'You divide future lesson fees with separate credits. {companion} keeps the freedom to return or sing somewhere else.',
