            "outcome": "You walk new watchers through the rotten boards and misplaced hooks. Fear becomes something they can question, without pretending the unexplained voices were never heard.",
            "days": 6,
            "cost": 10,
            "reward": 0,
            "skill": {
              "id": "scholarship",
              "min": 4
            },
            "effect": "school"
